1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,227
5 things you must never do in Iran.

2
00:00:02,557 --> 00:00:06,972
One. Don't photograph government
buildings, police, or military sites.

3
00:00:06,992 --> 00:00:08,829
It's banned, drones included.

4
00:00:09,209 --> 00:00:12,227
Two. Don't count on cards.
It's a cash economy,

5
00:00:12,247 --> 00:00:14,444
and ATMs are for local banks only.

6
00:00:14,824 --> 00:00:18,660
Three. Don't wear shorts. The
dress code is strictly enforced,

7
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:19,799
for men and women.

8
00:00:20,179 --> 00:00:22,396
Four. Don't carry alcohol or drugs.

9
00:00:22,416 --> 00:00:24,014
The penalties are severe.

10
00:00:24,394 --> 00:00:27,071
Five. Don't believe the first "it's free.

11
00:00:27,091 --> 00:00:31,281
" That's taarof. A driver may
refuse payment two or three times,

12
00:00:31,301 --> 00:00:32,617
and still expect it.

